{
  "name": "dsh-right-panel",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "DSH web GUI 右侧面板插件：项目会话打开时聊天区右侧出现「预览」与「文件/变更」两块面板（文件树 / 文件名搜索 / 10+ 格式多 tab 预览 / 真实 git stage·unstage·discard / 宽度拖拽与按项目持久化 / 拖文件入输入框）。复用 zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui 的 dsh-aionui-panel（Apache-2.0）发布产物。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0"
}
